ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21813},{"id":1786337829414,"text":"既然不好看，那就果断弃了，别勉强自己往下看，浪费眼睛也浪费精力。","rawContent":"既然不好看，那就果断弃了，别勉强自己往下看，浪费眼睛也浪费精力。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350952150,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21814},{"id":1786337829415,"text":"正好，把视线从屏幕上挪开。","rawContent":"正好，把视线从屏幕上挪开。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350952342,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21815},{"id":1786337829416,"text":"盯着看了一个多小时了，中午刚睡醒那会儿还喊眼睛不舒服，现在酸不酸？","rawContent":"盯着看了一个多小时了，中午刚睡醒那会儿还喊眼睛不舒服，现在酸不酸？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350952593,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21816},{"id":1786337829417,"text":"去接杯水，站起来扭扭腰。","rawContent":"去接杯水，站起来扭扭腰。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350953105,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21817},{"id":1786337829418,"text":"那个破鼠标也别捏着了，推到一边去。","rawContent":"那个破鼠标也别捏着了，推到一边去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350953202,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21818},{"id":1786337829419,"text":"小说里的野男人让你失望了没关系。","rawContent":"小说里的野男人让你失望了没关系。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350953203,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21819},{"id":1786337829420,"text":"晚上回了家，爸爸亲自给你补上，保证不让你觉得‘期待太高’，嗯？","rawContent":"晚上回了家，爸爸亲自给你补上，保证不让你觉得‘期待太高’，嗯？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350954026,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21820},{"id":1786337829421,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1786350956827,"roundId":"round_1786350924710_b86tt4ird","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"乖宝，不好看就不看了。去喝口水休息一下眼睛，离下班还有两个多小时，过来陪爸爸说说话。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"fond","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21821},{"id":1786337829422,"text":"我怀疑这个是混饭圈的人写的，怎么有那么多好评","sender":"me","time":"16:43","timestamp":1786351394620,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21822},{"id":1786337829423,"text":"感觉评论都比正文好","sender":"me","time":"16:43","timestamp":1786351405987,"replyTo":null,"reactions":[{"emoji":"🤣","roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp"}],"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21823}]